Tanks for the clarification. I didn't even imagine that this big random com=
pound cmavo would be valid! You made my evening! ;-)

About {lonu} entry, I clearly agree. But I can't filter all them out... Or =
can I? If you get any (simple) idea of rule for that, then go ahead!

By the way, I already filtered out a few words. I indeed found some of huge=
 length (even a weird one about Macarena!). As it may be spam, I added an a=
rbitrary rule that throws away all that have more than 22 characters. Maybe=
 a finer rule has to be found...

Cheers,

--=20
